# MATERIAL & LOOT SYSTEM

## Overview

Material & Loot System mengatur seluruh material yang diperoleh Hero dari:

```text
Floor Mission
Dungeon
Boss Raid
World Exploration
Quest
Town Activity
Monster Drop
Gathering
Event
Treasure
```

Material digunakan untuk:

```text
Crafting
Equipment
Weapon
Armor
Accessory
Building
Town Facility
Upgrade
Repair
Quest
Trade
Economy
```

---

# 1. SYSTEM FLOW

```text
MISSION
   │
   ↓
LOOT TABLE
   │
   ↓
MATERIAL RNG
   │
   ↓
MATERIAL
   │
   ├── Inventory
   │
   ├── Crafting
   │
   ├── Equipment
   │
   ├── Town
   │
   ├── Quest
   │
   └── Economy
```

