# 18. SPECIAL FLOOR MATERIAL

Material tertentu hanya tersedia di Floor tertentu.

```text
Floor 1–10
→ Basic Material

Floor 11–20
→ Improved Material

Floor 21–50
→ Rare Material

Floor 51–100
→ Epic Material

Floor 100+
→ Legendary / Special Material
```

Contoh:

```text
Forest Floor
→ Ancient Wood
→ Healing Flower
→ Beast Hide

Volcanic Floor
→ Fire Crystal
→ Obsidian
→ Dragon Scale

Frozen Floor
→ Ice Crystal
→ Frost Core
→ Frozen Gem

Dark Dungeon
→ Dark Crystal
→ Shadow Essence
→ Ancient Rune
```

