# 46. CORE DESIGN RULES

```text
RULE 01
Every material must have a unique Material_ID.

RULE 02
Material_ID must never change after creation.

RULE 03
Materials can be obtained from Missions,
Dungeons, Bosses, Exploration, Quests,
Events, and Town activities.

RULE 04
Material quantity is determined by Loot RNG.

RULE 05
Material rarity affects drop probability.

RULE 06
Floor level affects available material pools.

RULE 07
Bosses have exclusive Boss Material.

RULE 08
Materials can be used by Crafting System.

RULE 09
Materials can be processed into refined materials.

RULE 10
Materials can be stored in Inventory.

RULE 11
Materials can be used by Town Facilities.

RULE 12
Materials can be requested by Quest System.

RULE 13
Materials can be sold through Economy System.

RULE 14
Material price can change dynamically.

RULE 15
Mission Potential Skills may affect material acquisition.

RULE 16
Special materials can be reserved for
high-level progression and unique crafting.

RULE 17
All material values, drop rates, stack limits,
and crafting requirements must be configurable.

RULE 18
New materials can be added without changing
existing Material_ID values.
```
